g calls.","Downstream p95 latency from orders-api to inventory-service /reserve jumped from 5ms baseline to 709ms at t=120s, mirroring the inventory-service latency.","All other services (postgres, redis) show stable metrics: db_pool_acquire_p95 stable at 1ms, cache miss rate increase is small (0.18 to 0.21 mean) and peaks later (t=180s), postgres active connections and query time unchanged."],"reasoning":"The symptom is high p95 latency on orders-api POST /orders, but the earliest moving metric is the downstream latency to inventory-service /reserve. The inventory-service's own p95 latency for POST /reserve spiked from 5ms to 48ms at t=120s, then to near 1 second, while orders-api's latency followed. The log 'admin: delay set' at 12:56:56 with 800ms directly explains the spike. The timing aligns: delay set at 12:56:56, first measurable latency increase at t=120s (12:57:03). Orders-api latency increase is a consequence, not a cause. Database and cache metrics are largely unchanged, ruling them out. The request rate to both services remained constant (3 req/s), eliminating a traffic surge.","confidence":"high","cause_service":"inventory-service","evidence_gaps":["No metrics from inventory-service's internal resources (CPU, memory, thread pools) to confirm it's purely an injected delay versus a resource constraint.","Lack of logs detailing who/what triggered the 'admin: delay set' or whether it was intentional.","No error logs from inventory-service indicating other failures beyond the delay."],"suggested_fix":"Immediately check inventory-service for any active latency injection configuration (e.g., feature flags, admin endpoints, chaos engineering tools). Revert the delay setting. Confirm fix by monitoring inventory-service POST /reserve p95 latency returning to baseline ~5ms and orders-api warning logs stopping.","probable_cause":"An intentional or accidental 800-millisecond delay (simulated latency) was set on the inventory-service /reserve endpoint at 12:56:56.377, making downstream calls from orders-api slow."}}]}